OL,3,GNEWSAScottish mountain rescue team
OL,4,Acalled out a record 200 times this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's busiest mountain rescue team
OL,7,Fhas broken its record for the number of
OL,8,Fcall-outs it gets in a year.
OL,10,FFour incidents at the weekend pushed
OL,11,FFort William-based Lochaber MRT to more
OL,12,Fthan 200 for 2026 so far.
OL,14,FThe rescues included a missing person,
OL,15,Fan injured mountain biker and a group
OL,16,Fof hillwalkers unable to navigate off
OL,17,Fthe summit of Ben Nevis - Britain's
OL,18,Fhighest mountain - in the dark.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
