OL,3,GNEWSAScottish mountain rescue team
OL,4,Acalled out a record 200 times this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team, which attended 160 call-outs
OL,7,Ffor the whole of last year, said more
OL,8,Fpeople were heading into the hills,
OL,9,Fwith some poorly equipped or
OL,10,Fill-prepared for difficult conditions.
